dist/
deploy/sites.json
deploy/scratch_site_id
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# The brand asset generator's caches. The two Open Graph cards ARE
# committed (see assets/brand/generated/), because the build needs them
# and CI cannot run the generator — it installs no packages and has no
# headless Chrome. Everything else in that directory is regenerable with
# `python3.12 make_brand_assets.py` and is not a build input.
assets/brand/Inter.ttf
assets/brand/generated/*
!assets/brand/generated/og-corporate.png
!assets/brand/generated/og-aware.png

# The off-repo brand assets ARE committed too. They are not a build
# input, but they are the exact files uploaded to a third-party surface
# (LinkedIn), so the bytes that are live must be recoverable from the
# repository rather than from one operator's Downloads folder. They are
# regenerable with `python3.12 make_offsite_assets.py`.
!assets/brand/generated/linkedin-avatar-goodciso.png
!assets/brand/generated/linkedin-cover-goodciso.png
